OL,3,GNEWSAScilly Isles ferry set for
OL,4,Aemotional final voyage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people are expected to mark
OL,7,Fthe end of an era as the Scillonian III
OL,8,Fmakes its final passenger sailing
OL,9,Fbetween Penzance and the Isles of
OL,10,FScilly.
OL,12,FThe ship, which can carry 486
OL,13,Fpassengers, is due to depart from
OL,14,FPenzance at 09:00 GMT and arrive at St
OL,15,FMary's at 11:45.
OL,17,FThe ferry, which has served generations
OL,18,Fof islanders, visitors and businesses,
OL,19,Fis due to leave St Mary's at 14:00 for
OL,20,Fthe last time as part of a farewell day
OL,21,Forganised by the Isles of Scilly
OL,22,FSteamship Group.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
