OL,5,
OL,6,FA flotilla of vessels is expected to
OL,7,Faccompany the ship on its departure
OL,8,Ffrom St Mary's and a musical reception
OL,9,Fby the Cape Cornwall Singers is planned
OL,10,Fin Penzance.
